<title>JAPAN: Natwest launches 3 bln yen callable euroyen bond.</title>
<headline>Natwest launches 3 bln yen callable euroyen bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable euroyen</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead-manager New Japan Securities on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  National Westminster Bank</p>
<p> AMT		 3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    first year- 1.00 pct. second year- 1.70 pct,</p>
<p>			third year- 2.40 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> MATURITY	  21 August 2000</p>
</text>
